From: Leonardo Grasso <me@leonardograsso.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mermaid-text): join flowchart edge endpoints and order fan-in

Join rectangular source borders and first route cells from final paths, not
nominal centre-port corners. Use shafted arrows and preserve ASCII conversion.
Order vertical rectangular fan-in by its source and separate its ports. Keep
labels and sequence rendering unchanged. Separate incoming/outgoing ports and
keep labels off other routed edges, even in fallback placement. Include drawing
updates for these intentional endpoint changes.

